1
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:02,060
歌洛莉亚 亲爱的
Gloria, honey!

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:03,680
我随时都能出发
I'm ready whenever you are!

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,840
我们得快点了 预定时间是七点
We should hurry. The reservation's at 7:00.

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,840
克莱尔 你在哪儿
Claire, where are you?

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:08,820
好 两分钟后见
Okay, see you in two.

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,320
你在干什么呢
What are you doing?

7
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,500
我想摆个性感僚人的姿势给你妈看
I'm striking a seductive pose for your mother.

8
00:00:17,796 --> 00:00:20,120
真恶 不过我喜欢这套西装 新的吗
Gross. But I like the suit. Is that new?

9
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:20,780
是啊
Oh, yeah.

10
00:00:20,801 --> 00:00:22,306
爹爹的小心肝都开始挣钱了
Now that his honey gots her own money,

11
00:00:22,306 --> 00:00:25,070
爹爹自然要给自己买套新衣裳 闺女
daddy went and snagged hisself some new threads, girl.

12
00:00:25,688 --> 00:00:27,400
这绝对是你最搞笑的声音
Hands down, your funniest voice.

13
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:28,480
快让人觉得恶心了
Bordering on the offensive.

14
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,260
你看 我是房地产经纪人
Listen, I'm a realtor,

15
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,440
得与很多家庭打交道
and I work a lot with families,

16
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,920
所以通常我不能表现得太性感
so normally, I dial the sexy back to five,

17
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:37,420
但克莱尔最近工作非常辛苦
but Claire's been working very hard lately.

18
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,480
所以今晚...
So tonight...

19
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,320
留下来看你们的妈妈
Stick around if you want to see

20
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,760
被我迷得口水直流吧
your mom's tongue fall out of her mouth.

21
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,080
还是算了 除非你想看我把午饭吐出来
Not unless you want to see my lunch fall out of mine.

22
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,460
抱歉我回来晚了
Oh, I'm sorry I am late.

23
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:53,880
路上实在是太堵了
Traffic was horrible.

24
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,520
看起来有人急需一大杯水啊
Sounds like someone could use a tall drink of water.

25
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:58,280
是啊 对 水
Yeah, right. Water.

26
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:02,920
卢克 我是怎么跟你说
Luke, what did I tell you about

27
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:03,780
坐在椅子上向后仰的
leaning back on that thing?

28
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,860
不知道 是"不许这样"吗
I don't know. "Don't"?

29
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,380
亲爱的 你怎么还在这里
Honey, what are you still doing here?

30
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:07,720
你应该去照看乔了啊
You're supposed to be babysitting Joe.

31
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,880
是 但我得先载艾丽克斯去照看莉莉
Yeah, but I have to drop off Alex to watch Lily first,

32
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,880
但她还没准备好
and she's still not ready.

33
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:13,060
她不会是在穿衣打扮什么的吧
She can't be concerned about her looks, right?

34
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:14,720
-我听得见 -我开玩笑的
- I can hear you! - I'm kidding.

35
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:15,400
我只是想说
I'm just saying,

36
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:17,180
如果她还试图打扮就挺可悲的
it'd be sad to think she actually tries.

37
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,020
-又听到了 -开玩笑的啦
- Heard that, too! - It was a joke!

38
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,720
老天 大耳朵真的听得更清楚吗
Man, do big ears actually hear better?

39
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,580
我的天哪 别再说了
Oh, my God, just stop talking.

40
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:23,840
好了 姑娘们
Okay, girls.

41
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:26,240
你们该出发啦
It's time for you guys to hit the road.

42
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:26,851
好了 再见
Okay, bye.

43
00:01:26,851 --> 00:01:28,040
-再见 -拜拜
- Oh, yeah, bye. - Bye.

44
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:28,880
你为什么不跟她们一起去
Why aren't you going with them?

45
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,160
他想待在家里
He wanted to stay home.

46
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,000
我同意了
I said it was okay.

47
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:33,100
-他自己吗 -没关系的
- By himself? - It's fine.

48
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:35,240
如果他能和我一起看《行尸走肉》
If he's old enough to watch "The Walking Dead" with me...

49
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:36,090
-他还不行 -他就可以
- He's not. - then he's old enough

50
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,580
-一个人待在家里了 -他还不行
- to stay home alone. - He's not.

51
00:01:37,720 --> 00:01:39,100
克莱尔 他不是小孩子了
Claire, he's not a little boy anymore.

52
00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:42,900
我没事
I'm fine.

53
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:44,680
你听他的声音多么低沉
See how deep his voice is?

54
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,780
你还好吗
Are you okay?!

55
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:04,700
是海莉的短信
Oh, this is Haley.

56
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:07,600
"五点到 艾丽克斯特么磨蹭死了"
"Be there in 5. Alex took ducking forever."

57
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:08,740
没关系 你知道吗
Oh, it's fine. You know what?

58
00:02:08,780 --> 00:02:10,160
我们得选一张"预留时间"卡片
We have to pick the "Save the date" card.

59
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:10,920
我好纠结
I'm at a loss.

60
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,840
我们能明天再选吗
Can we just do it tomorrow?

61
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:13,660
我讨厌我们迟到时我爸看我们的眼神
I hate the way my dad looks at us when we're late,

62
00:02:13,740 --> 00:02:15,100
就好像我们是两个傻基佬
like we're two silly queens

63
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:16,300
一边听迪斯科音乐
blasting disco music,

64
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,960
一边梳洗打扮 毫无时间观念
primping, losing track of time.

65
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,760
你这小脑瓜想象力真丰富
Wow, it gets really busy in that head, huh?

66
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:21,620
快点 你喜欢哪一张
Okay, quick. Which one do you like?

67
00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:23,040
-那张 -真的吗
- Uh, that one. - Really?

68
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:23,840
我觉得你太草率了
I think you picked too quick.

69
00:02:23,980 --> 00:02:25,320
不 没有 我真的很喜欢那张
No, I didn't. I really like that one.

70
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,220
我真的很喜欢这张
I really like this one.

71
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:28,200
那你特么为什么还要问我
Well, then, why did you ducking ask me?

72
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:29,260
好吧 听你的
Fine, goes with yours.

73
00:02:29,260 --> 00:02:30,260
如果你真喜欢的话 就听你的
Well, if that's the one you really like.

74
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,340
你能快点准备好吗
Can you just get ready?

75
00:02:31,440 --> 00:02:32,620
行 莉莉 开始
Yeah. Lily, hit it.

76
00:02:32,660 --> 00:02:33,380
遵命
On it!

77
00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:41,900
快点 快点走啊 快点
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

78
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,880
我从没见你这么迫不及待要去一家餐厅
I've never seen you so excited about a restaurant.

79
00:02:43,940 --> 00:02:45,940
这次预定我已经等了六周了
I've waited six weeks for this reservation.

80
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,860
那家餐厅有澳大利亚神户牛肉
They have an Australian Wagyu beef

81
00:02:48,860 --> 00:02:50,400
简直会颠覆你的人生
that's supposed to change your life.

82
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,330
通过心脏病颠覆你的人生吗
In the way heart disease changes your life?

83
00:02:52,340 --> 00:02:53,720
你真是健康的使者
Because you're a pillar of health.

84
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:57,840
这种牛只吃苜蓿 大麦和红酒
They only feed this cow alfalfa, barley, and red wine,

85
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:00,960
每块肉都经过厨师手工挑选
and some chef hand-picks each cut,

86
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:03,247
然后风干35天
dry ages it 35 days

87
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:05,780
才做成一道完美的三分熟牛排
before cooking it to a perfect medium-rare,

88
00:03:06,407 --> 00:03:07,200
一切都是为我而做
all for me.

89
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,660
牛喝酒不会醉吗
Doesn't the wine make the cow drunk?

90
00:03:08,780 --> 00:03:10,800
这不是在漫画里 牛又不用开车去哪里
It's not "The Far Dide." The cow doesn't drive anywhere.

91
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:11,840
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

92
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:13,220
快点走了
Let's go!

93
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,540
你知道她不在这里吧
You know she's not here, right?

94
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:14,880
什么
What?

95
00:03:15,180 --> 00:03:16,480
她在外面吹头发呢
She's having her hair blown out.

96
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:18,080
就这么个事儿
That's a thing?

97
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,320
要花钱去做吗
That I pay for?

98
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,960
歌洛莉亚总是迟到
Gloria's always late.

99
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:22,600
然后我就会生气 让她动作快点
Then I get mad and tell her to hurry.

100
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,340
我们会争吵 结果耽误了更多时间
We yell, and it just takes longer.

101
00:03:24,580 --> 00:03:27,280
所以我暗中发誓 无论她多慢
So I promised myself, no matter how late she is,

102
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:29,380
我就深呼吸几下 保持镇定
just to take some deep breaths and stay calm.

103
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,400
这是我在无痛分娩课上学到的唯一一点
That's the only thing I learned in lamaze class

104
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,440
因为我们那时也总是迟到
because we were always late.

105
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:38,540
今天晚上大家都跟疯子似的
Hi! Everybody's running like crazy tonight.

106
00:03:38,540 --> 00:03:41,440
我走了圣维森特路 以为会节省时间
I took San Vicente thinking that I was gonna save some time,

107
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:43,240
结果那里在修下水道
but then they're working on the sewer.

108
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,620
所以我绕道蒙大纳路
So I went around Montana,

109
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,660
又开到莫雷诺路上
down Moreno.

110
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:48,040
但是那条路上有个坑
But then there's that dip in the road.

111
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,760
我总是忘记路上有个坑
I always forget about that dip in the road.

112
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:53,720
车颠得太厉害 我把咖啡洒得到处都是
I hit it so hard that I spilled the coffee all over the car.

113
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:55,980
我跟你说我和谁去喝咖啡了吗
Did I tell you who I had coffee with?

114
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:02,080
我觉得卢克害怕被单独留在家里
I think Luke is scared to be left in the house alone,

115
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:04,440
他只是为了你表现得勇敢
and he's just pretending to be brave for you.

116
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,980
亲爱的 他都14岁了
Honey, he's 14.

117
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:07,860
艾丽克斯10岁时我们就让她一人在家了
We left Alex alone when she was 10.

118
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,660
不是"让" 而是把她忘在家里了
We didn't leave her. We forgot her.

119
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,900
我们赶回家时她不是好好的吗
And when we got home, she was fine.

120
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:12,760
身体上没事
Physically.

121
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,300
而且她和那个可爱的911接线员
Plus, she's still friends with

122
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:15,580
现在还是好朋友呢
that sweet 911 operator.

123
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:16,360
是啊
Yeah.

124
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:17,800
你在干什么
What are you doing?

125
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,000
确保卢克知道
Making sure Luke knows

126
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,340
发生意外时该怎么做
what to do in case of emergency.

127
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,000
他当然知道
Of course he does.

128
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:25,000
有人按门铃
Someone's at the door!

129
00:04:25,900 --> 00:04:27,820
卢克 这是你妈妈在测试你
Luke, it's just your mom testing you.

130
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:28,980
别担心 妈
Don't worry, mom.

131
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:30,420
你们不在时如果我听到这声音
If I hear that while you're gone,

132
00:04:30,460 --> 00:04:31,340
我不会开门的
I won't answer.

133
00:04:31,760 --> 00:04:33,300
我就躲在没人能找到的地方
I'll just hide where no one can find me.

134
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,580
小卡 我们快走吧
Cam, come on, let's go.

135
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,280
再等两秒钟
Two seconds.

136
00:04:38,580 --> 00:04:39,840
我还以为和男人在一起
I thought that being with a man

137
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,520
意味着我不必这样苦苦等待
meant that I wouldn't have to wait around like this.

138
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,880
我觉得受到了欺骗 真的
I feel cheated. I do.

139
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:44,960
我们来玩洋娃娃吧
Let's play dolls.

140
00:04:45,860 --> 00:04:47,900
其实 我想给你读我最爱的一本书
Actually, I want to read you one of my favorite books.

141
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,920
书名是《小妇人》 讲的是四姐妹
It's called "Little Women," and it's about four sisters

142
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:52,140
克服贫困和父权制的故事...
who overcome poverty and the patriarchy...

143
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:53,940
不听 玩娃娃
Nope! Dolls.

144
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:56,260
这是阿什莉 她是个家庭主妇
This is Ashley. She's a wife.

145
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:59,020
希望她不只是个家庭主妇而已
Well, I hope that's not the only thing that defines her.

146
00:04:59,660 --> 00:05:00,620
她有事业吗
Does she have a career?

147
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,980
不 她只购物 海莉在哪
Nope, she shops. Where's Haley?

148
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:05,420
我怎么五分钟就准备好了
How come it takes me five minutes to get ready,

149
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:06,300
而你还在磨磨蹭蹭呢
and you take forever?

150
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:08,180
拜托 我也能在五分钟内准备好
Oh, please. I could get ready in five minutes, too,

151
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:08,960
如果我穿得像...
if I dressed like --

152
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,120
你们又撞衫了
You did it again.

153
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,040
誓死不换
Not changing.

154
00:05:13,082 --> 00:05:15,280
系好安全带
Fasten your seatbelts.

155
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:16,980
这会是个疯狂的夜晚
It's going to be a crazy night.

156
00:05:16,980 --> 00:05:19,200
不 亲爱的 这会是个不太平的夜晚
No, honey, it's gonna be a bumpy night.

157
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,260
记住 你有两个爸爸
Remember, you can't have two dads

158
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:21,020
不能犯这种错误
and make that mistake.

159
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,020
不太平的夜晚
Bumpy night.

160
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:24,180
好吧 这种事多久发生一次
Okay, so how often does this happen?

161
00:05:24,340 --> 00:05:24,920
太频繁
Too often.

162
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,020
男人没有太多选择
Men just don't have that many options.

163
00:05:27,180 --> 00:05:28,520
简直数不清有多少次
I can't tell you the number of times

164
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,720
我经过女士服装店时
I've walked by a women's boutique

165
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,160
心里想"我愿付出一切
and just thought, "What I would do

166
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,040
来换取那么多的选择"
to have that many choices."

167
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,760
永远别这样说了
Don't ever say that again.

168
00:05:33,780 --> 00:05:34,920
我一点也不喜欢
I don't like any part of it.

169
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,220
好吧 必须得有个人去换衣服
All right, one of us has to change.

170
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:37,580
我们看起来像教堂里的双胞胎小孩
We look like twin toddlers at church.

171
00:05:37,660 --> 00:05:38,420
谁说不是啊
Yeah, tell me about it.

172
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:40,255
而且我们要去的地方很高端
And this place we're going is supposed to be super hip.

173
00:05:40,255 --> 00:05:41,980
说不定会碰到熟人
We're probably gonna run into someone.

174
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:43,840
拜托 我没有你衣服多
And come on. I don't have that many outfits.

175
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:46,580
我的衣服只占了衣柜的四分之一
My clothes take up exactly one-quarter of the closet.

176
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,280
这样说可不公平 我的衣服比你大
That's not fair. My clothes are bigger than yours.

177
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,046
好吧 我不想打这张牌
All right, I hate to play this card,

178
00:05:49,046 --> 00:05:50,100
但我先换好衣服的 所以
but I was dressed first. So...

179
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:51,560
真愚蠢
Oh, that is silly.

180
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:54,080
莉莉 该玩"谁穿上更好看"的游戏了
Lily, it's time to play "Who wore it best?"

181
00:05:55,620 --> 00:05:57,800
不 我不玩了 我做不到
No, I'm not doing this again. I can't.

182
00:05:57,820 --> 00:05:58,800
好吧 艾丽克斯你来
Fine. Alex.

183
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,400
我不知道
Uh, I don't know.

184
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:03,398
男士衣服我不太懂
Boys' clothes aren't really my thing.

185
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:04,320
真的吗
Really?

186
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:10,220
我不明白
I don't get it.

187
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:11,700
牛喝了酒难道不会醉吗
Doesn't the wine get the cow drunk?

188
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:13,080
-谢谢你 -天啊
- Thank you. - Honest to God.

189
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:14,220
你俩都没见过牛吗
Have neither of you seen a cow?

190
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,220
它们体型庞大
They're huge.

191
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,580
我敢说龙舌兰酒会让它们醉得更快
I bet tequila would do it quicker.

192
00:06:16,740 --> 00:06:18,760
目的不是为了让牛喝醉
It's not the goal to get the cow drunk.

193
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:19,946
没搞错吧
You got to be kidding me.

194
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:21,580
曼尼 去看看你妈怎么磨蹭那么久
Manny, see why your mother's taking so long.

195
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:23,520
别告诉她是我让你去的
And don't tell her I sent you.

196
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:24,740
妈 快点
Mom! Hurry!

197
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,180
别吼啊 我自己也能吼
Don't yell. I could have yelled.

198
00:06:26,260 --> 00:06:27,900
-那你为什么不吼 -因为我不想吼
- Then why didn't you? - Because I didn't want to yell.

199
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,660
-我想让你过去 -你为什么不去
- I want you to go. - Why can't you go?

200
00:06:29,660 --> 00:06:30,880
你怎么就不能乖乖听话呢
Why can't you do what I ask?

201
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,620
我在努力使用新方法
I'm trying to do something new here!

202
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:34,640
别吼了 杰 我准备好了
Stop yelling, Jay! I'm ready!

203
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:35,500
天啊
Oh, geez.

204
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:38,040
海莉 曼尼知道婴儿用的东西放在哪里
Haley, Manny knows where all the baby stuff is,

205
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,060
如果乔不肯睡觉
and if Joe won't go to bed,

206
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:40,040
就给他放格拉迪斯·奈特的歌曲
just put on Gladys Knight

207
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:40,920
然后轻轻摇晃他
and bounce him around a little bit.

208
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,120
你还这样做吗
Oh, you still do that?

209
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,440
我以前就很喜欢你摇晃我们
I loved when you did that with us.

210
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,240
怎么样
How about that?

211
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:46,340
这家里还有人记得我做过的好事
Somebody in this family remembers a nice thing I did.

212
00:06:46,540 --> 00:06:48,020
我记得你做过的好事
I remember something nice you did.

213
00:06:48,320 --> 00:06:50,900
你昨天上班时给我买了这条裙子
You bought me this dress yesterday when you were working.

214
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:52,120
我看起来怎么样
How do I look?

215
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:53,320
美极了 我们走吧
Gorgeous. Let's go!

216
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:55,340
你都没看我 海莉
You didn't even look at me. Haley.

217
00:06:55,340 --> 00:06:56,780
首先 你的发型看起来棒极了
Well, "A," your hair looks amazing,

218
00:06:56,780 --> 00:06:57,880
就像是刚从马背上下来似的
like you just got off a horse.

219
00:06:58,180 --> 00:06:59,840
那正是我想要的效果
That's exactly what I was going for.

220
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:01,020
不过我觉得吧...
But if I had one thought...

221
00:07:01,029 --> 00:07:01,920
别 别觉得
No! No thoughts.

222
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,520
那对耳环不是最适合的
...are those for sure the best earrings?

223
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,920
感觉不是很显眼
They seem to be kind of getting lost.

224
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,760
我还有一副这个颜色大一号的
I have the same color in a bigger size.

225
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:07,980
-大多少 -一米左右
- How much bigger? - Like a meter.

226
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,360
一米都有一英尺长了
A meter? That's like a foot.

227
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,500
其实应该是一码才对
Actually, it's like a yard.

228
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:11,860
对不起 应该是一毫米左右
Oh, sorry -- it's like a millimeter.

229
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:12,940
你想说的是一厘米吧
You mean a centimeter.

230
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:14,640
数学真麻烦 给我看一下好了
All this math. Just show me.

231
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,480
-歌洛莉亚 -怎么的
- Gloria! - What?

232
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,840
我觉得那副新耳环
I think the new earrings

233
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:23,240
一定会和你的整套造型非常搭
are really gonna tie your whole outfit together.

234
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,400
你嘴真甜
You're so sweet!

235
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,780
你刚才的表现成熟多了
Wow. That was very mature of you.

236
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:30,360
是啊 我现在的确比
Yeah, well, I'm a lot older now

237
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,720
她开始打扮之前老多了
than when she started getting dressed.

238
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:35,660
所以这个声音
So this sound...

239
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:37,740
才是门铃声
...that's the doorbell.

240
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:40,140
之前那个声音是烟雾报警器
That other sound was the smoke alarm.

241
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:40,860
知道了
Got it.

242
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:42,900
如果你饿了 不要叫批萨外卖
Okay, and if you're hungry, don't order a pizza.

243
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,340
他们的配送员都没有经过筛选
They don't screen those delivery guys.

244
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:45,540
那些人多半都是有前科的
Half of them are ex-cons.

245
00:07:45,685 --> 00:07:48,232
够了 你会吓到他的 不会有事的
Stop it. You're gonna scare him. It's gonna be fine.

246
00:07:48,232 --> 00:07:49,750
不过万一你噎住了 你要这样
But if you do choke, you've gotta throw yourself

247
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:51,400
撞在椅子背上以便把食物吐出来
against the back of a chair to get the food out.

248
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:52,840
他喝点东西就行了
He'll just drink stuff.

249
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:54,120
不要拿水槽下面的东西喝
Nothing from under the sink.

250
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:55,080
连柠檬味的也不行吗
Even if it's lemony?

251
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:56,800
我跟你开玩笑的
I'm just messing with you.

252
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,940
要是着火 就俯下身子跑出去
In case of fire, go low and get out.

253
00:07:58,940 --> 00:08:00,060
要是遇到地震
In case of earthquake --

254
00:08:00,060 --> 00:08:01,500
等一下 你们觉得会发生地震吗
Wait. You think there could be an earthquake?

255
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,760
上次地震时 我被那个大柜子压住了
The last time we had one, that big cabinet fell on me.

256
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:04,780
-没有的事 -真的吗
- No, it didn't. - It did?!

257
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:06,440
我们走吧
Let's go.

258
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:07,740
再见 亲爱的 我们爱你
Bye, honey, we love you.

259
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:08,440
你有钥匙没
Do you have the keys?

260
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,953
我们会给你打电话的 我保证
We're gonna check in. I promise!

261
00:08:15,448 --> 00:08:17,208
怎么回事
Uhh, what's going on?

262
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:17,880
新西服
New suit?

263
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:19,167
这个吗
This old thing?

264
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:20,060
是啊 是新的
Yes, it is.

265
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,360
我在市里潮人集散地买的
I got it at this hipster place downtown.

266
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:23,520
你喜欢吗
You like it?

267
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:25,300
有点儿紧
It's tight.

268
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:27,060
售货员说现在流行这种风格
Well, the salesman said it was the style,

269
00:08:27,060 --> 00:08:28,280
他看上去像个蒙福之子乐队成员
and he looked like a Mumford and Son,

270
00:08:28,280 --> 00:08:29,060
我以为他很了解时尚
so I think he'd know.

271
00:08:29,060 --> 00:08:30,440
我们走吧
Mm, let's go.

272
00:08:33,821 --> 00:08:35,437
慢一点 女飞人
Slow down, Flo Jo.

273
00:08:38,020 --> 00:08:39,620
我们没有时间争论这些了
You know what? We don't have time for this.

274
00:08:39,680 --> 00:08:40,300
我直接换衣服好了
I'll just change.

275
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,560
这让我好内疚 我们还是一起换了吧
Well, now I feel bad. Let's both just change.

276
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:43,700
这样做才公平
That's the fair thing to do.

277
00:08:43,700 --> 00:08:46,000
好的 但是请你快一点
Okay, fine. But quickly, pLemony Snicketlease.

278
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,100
我不知道
I don't know.

279
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,260
这件是蓝色的
It's blue.

280
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:59,140
这件又太黄了
Yeah, this one's so yellow.

281
00:09:00,020 --> 00:09:00,900
你猜怎么着
Oh, you know what?

282
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:02,920
这件衣服上有块污渍 我不能穿这件
I have a stain on this one. I can't wear it.

283
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,340
涡纹图案 不错 我不确定
Oh, paisley, yeah. I don't know.

284
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,780
你是在跟我开玩笑吗
Are you kidding me right now?!

285
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:09,000
-怎么了 -我知道你在耍什么把戏
- What? - I know this trick, Cam.

286
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,720
你永远也挑不出一套衣服
You take forever to pick out an outfit,

287
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:12,500
你知道我肯定会说"我们走吧"
knowing very well that I'll say, "Let's just go,"

288
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:13,220
因为我们已经迟了
because we're late.

289
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:15,260
这么一来 你做了提议换装的好人
Meantime, you get credit for offering to change

290
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:16,660
而我却是真正换装的那个人
while I'm the one who actually does.

291
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:17,960
-你一向如此 -你说什么
- As usual. - Excuse me.

292
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:21,360
你是在指责我操纵你按我的方式做事吗
Are you accusing me of manipulating you to get my way?

293
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,160
其实...
Actually...

294
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:24,900
因为我妈以前就是那么指责我的
Because that's what my mother used to accuse me of,

295
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:25,540
我不得不说
and I got to say

296
00:09:25,540 --> 00:09:27,680
那让我想起了好多伤心事
that that brings up a lot of stuff with me.

297
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,400
你连滴眼泪都挤不出来
You're crying without tears.

298
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:30,580
给我点时间
Give me a minute.

299
00:09:34,340 --> 00:09:36,380
"圣诞节要是没有礼物就不是圣诞节了"
"'Christmas won't be Christmas without any presents,'

300
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:37,484
"乔抱怨道"
"Grumbled Jo.

301
00:09:37,563 --> 00:09:39,840
"贫困真是可怕 她感叹着"
'it's so dreadful to be poor,' sighed --"

302
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,560
够了 我不爱听这个
Stop! I hate this.

303
00:09:42,460 --> 00:09:43,800
我能给你化妆吗
Can I put makeup on you?

304
00:09:43,980 --> 00:09:45,320
怎么总有人这么问我
Why does everyone ask me that?

305
00:09:45,580 --> 00:09:47,400
我们今晚就高高兴兴地享受一下行吗
Let's just have a good time tonight, all right?

306
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:49,140
-我没生气 -好 很好
- I'm not mad. - Okay, good.

307
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:51,180
而且你穿那套衣服帅呆酷毙了
And you do look super-duper handsome in that.

308
00:09:51,260 --> 00:09:51,900
别扯了
Don't even.

309
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,240
我去拿些水在路上喝
I'm gonna grab a water for the road.

310
00:09:53,300 --> 00:09:54,020
给我拿罐汽水
Yeah, get me a soda.

311
00:09:54,340 --> 00:09:55,840
好了 艾丽克斯 非常感谢你
Okay, Alex. Thank you so much.

312
00:09:55,900 --> 00:09:56,640
晚上玩得开心点
Have a fun night.

313
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:58,000
宝贝 我们爱你
Honey, we love you.

314
00:09:58,868 --> 00:10:01,180
-给你 -好的 谢谢
- Here you go. -All right. Thank you.

315
00:10:01,180 --> 00:10:02,760
记住 不许在客厅里吃东西
Okay, and remember, no eating in the living room.

316
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,363
我的天 我的天
Aah! Oh, my god! Oh, my god!

317
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:07,480
你做了什么 你做了什么
What did you do? What did you do?!

318
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:10,000
拜托 你不会以为...
Come on! You can't possibly think --

319
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:10,940
你摇晃这罐子来着
You shook this can

320
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:12,760
这样你就能穿这套我想穿的衣服了
so you could wear the outfit that I wanted to wear?

321
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,760
是的 我就是这么想的
That is exactly what I think!

322
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,580
这太荒谬了
That is insane.

323
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:16,900
你看着我把汽水从冰箱里
You saw me take it from the refrigerator

324
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:18,240
-拿出来给你的 -是吗
- and bring it to you. - Did I?

325
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:20,400
还是你趁我没注意
Or were you out of my sight for the two seconds

326
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:22,280
在从冰箱那里走过来的两秒钟里
that it took you to get from the refrigerator to here,

327
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,600
摇晃了这罐汽水 而两秒钟刚好足够
which would have given you exactly the right amount of time

328
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,200
用来摇晃汽水
to shake the can?

329
00:10:25,640 --> 00:10:27,920
真棒 大神探 但我没那么小心眼
Nice theory, Nancy Grace, but I'm not that petty.

330
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:30,340
你们俩看见什么没有
Okay, you two. Did you see anything?

331
00:10:30,660 --> 00:10:31,980
假装在涂色
Just pretend you're coloring.

332
00:10:38,700 --> 00:10:39,640
你在干嘛
Okay, what are you doing?

333
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:40,740
我在尝试够到镜子
I'm trying to reach the mirror.

334
00:10:40,860 --> 00:10:41,760
我眼睛里进东西了
I got something in my eye.

335
00:10:41,760 --> 00:10:43,000
你好 这里是邓菲家
Hi, you've reached the Dunphys.

336
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,480
卢克为什么不接电话
Why isn't Luke picking up?

337
00:10:44,860 --> 00:10:45,880
被一个刚被假释的
It's hard to reach the phone

338
00:10:45,880 --> 00:10:47,960
比萨配送员绑住 的确很难接电话
when you're tied up by a recently paroled pizza guy.

339
00:10:48,260 --> 00:10:49,380
你真幽默
Ha ha. You're very funny.

340
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:51,500
你干什么
What are you doing?

341
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:53,560
我知道这听起来很奇怪
I know it sounds weird.

342
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,420
也许是母亲的直觉吧
Call it mother's intuition,

343
00:10:54,420 --> 00:10:56,300
但我有种不祥的预感
but I just have this feeling that something is wrong.

344
00:10:56,300 --> 00:10:57,640
好吧 你爱怎样就怎样吧
Fine, do what you want,

345
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:59,226
但我已经忍了你...
but I've just about had it up to --

346
00:10:59,780 --> 00:11:01,300
比这还要多
higher than here with this.

347
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:05,420
去死吧 送比萨的
Die, pizza man!

348
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:09,320
住手 住手
Stop! Stop!

349
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:10,920
妈妈啊 对不起
Oh. Sorry, mom.

350
00:11:14,500 --> 00:11:15,860
告诉过你他能照顾好自己了
Told you he could take care of himself.

351
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:19,180
让开
Move.

352
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,480
她为什么要这样呢
Why does she do this?

353
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,525
我们的订位会被取消的
We're gonna lose our table.

354
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:31,020
她知道准时到达对我有多重要
She knows how important it is to me to be on time.

355
00:11:31,260 --> 00:11:32,180
真是折磨人
This is torture.

356
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,880
你重点搞错了吧 杰
I think you've lost perspective, Jay.

357
00:11:34,140 --> 00:11:35,460
你知道我愿付出多少来换取
You know what I would give to wait around

358
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,420
等待这样一个女人的权利吗
for a woman like that?

359
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:37,880
少来了 小变态
Reel it in, creepy.

360
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:39,080
你说的可是你亲娘
That's your mother up there.

361
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:40,600
抱歉 抱歉
Sorry, sorry.

362
00:11:40,780 --> 00:11:42,980
我换了耳环之后 就得把鞋子也换了
Once I changed the earrings, I had to change the shoes.

363
00:11:43,060 --> 00:11:44,940
然后我试穿了歌洛莉亚的一条裙子
And then I tried on one of Gloria's old dresses,

364
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:46,775
让我觉得自己像个10岁的小男孩
which made me feel like a 10-year-old boy.

365
00:11:46,775 --> 00:11:48,560
你身材很棒
Ay, your body's beautiful.

366
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:49,040
我同意
I agree.

367
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:50,420
留着对外人说去
Take it outside the family.

368
00:11:50,431 --> 00:11:51,924
准备好出发了吗
Okay, we ready to go?

369
00:11:51,934 --> 00:11:53,679
等等 我拿错了口红
Wait. I have the wrong lipstick.

370
00:11:53,679 --> 00:11:54,920
够了 我受够了
Oh! That's it! I've had it!

371
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,680
就给我一分钟
Just one minute!

372
00:11:55,700 --> 00:11:56,920
你不可能一分钟内做完
Nothing takes a minute with you.

373
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,100
我们现在就走
We're leaving right now.

374
00:11:58,140 --> 00:11:59,500
我不管你要干嘛
I don't care what you have to do.

375
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:01,360
你对我这么无礼也就算了
It's bad enough you're being rude to me,

376
00:12:01,360 --> 00:12:02,480
但你这样对那些
but you're being rude

377
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:04,480
在等着我们的人太不尊重了
to the people sitting there waiting for us!

378
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:07,180
不好意思 你们是最先到的
Sorry, you're the first to arrive,

379
00:12:07,189 --> 00:12:09,462
我们必须等到客人来齐后才能让您入座
and we can't seat you till everyone's here.

380
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,420
这下你开心了吧
I hope you're happy!

381
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,700
人都去哪儿了
Where the hell is everybody?

382
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,860
我讨厌这样等着别人
Yes, I hate waiting like this.

383
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:24,600
是吗
Do you?

384
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,800
就算其他人都迟到了
Just because everybody else is late

385
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:28,620
并不意味着我们迟到是对的
doesn't make it okay for us to be late.

386
00:12:28,620 --> 00:12:30,540
你总是吼我 我没法快速准备好
I can't get ready fast with all the yelling!

387
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,380
我没有吼你
I wasn't yelling.

388
00:12:31,540 --> 00:12:33,120
你又在吼我了
You see, you're doing it again!

389
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:35,780
歌洛莉亚 你每次都是这样
Gloria, you do this every single time.

390
00:12:35,860 --> 00:12:38,200
如果你清楚你要花很长时间准备
If you know how long it takes you to get ready,

391
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:39,640
为什么不早点开始呢
why don't you start earlier?

392
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:40,620
我有原因
I have my reasons.

393
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:42,055
能告诉我吗
I would love to know them.

394
00:12:42,300 --> 00:12:43,360
你会嘲笑人家的
You're going to be mean.

395
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,649
我保证我不会
I promise I won't be.

396
00:12:46,524 --> 00:12:48,020
我喜欢华丽地登场
I like to make an entrance.

397
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:50,000
你说什么
What's that, now?

398
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:52,800
我喜欢我走进去的时候
I like the part where I go in,

399
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:55,060
大家都在等我
and everybody's waiting for me,

400
00:12:55,060 --> 00:12:56,300
然后他们说
and they say,

401
00:12:57,760 --> 00:13:00,320
"歌洛莉亚 你看起来好漂亮
"Gloria, you look so pretty,

402
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:02,220
那裙子好美啊"
and that dress is so beautiful."

403
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:03,760
这样有什么不好吗
Is that so bad?

404
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:05,700
我不喜欢
I don't love it.

405
00:13:06,900 --> 00:13:09,420
这里真华丽呀
Oh, this room is so nice.

406
00:13:09,420 --> 00:13:12,280
是啊 华丽得像...你这个禽兽
I know. It's almost as gorgeous as -- you monster!

407
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,260
什么 这个吗
What? Oh, this?

408
00:13:14,580 --> 00:13:15,840
反正你也没法穿
Well, you know, you couldn't wear it,

409
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,540
所以我想 我何不穿呢
so I figured, what's the harm?

410
00:13:17,551 --> 00:13:19,340
好 你知道吗 我现在要走过去
Mm. Okay, you know what? I will go over there,

411
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:21,320
然后我会一如既往地魅力十足
and I will be as socially magnetic as I always am.

412
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:22,820
我们暂且不提这事
We will put this on the back burner,

413
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,660
但我希望你知道 我内心已经气炸了
but underneath, I want you to know, I am fuming.

414
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:27,280
杰 歌洛莉亚呢
Hey, Jay, where's Gloria?

415
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:29,215
她刚刚还在那儿呢
She's -- she was there a second --

416
00:13:29,215 --> 00:13:31,760
我的宝贝儿们来啦
There are my boys!

417
00:13:31,760 --> 00:13:33,400
歌洛莉亚 你真漂亮
Gloria, you look so pretty.

418
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:34,711
这裙子太美了
That dress is so beautiful.

419
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:37,829
有没有搞错
You got to be kidding me.

420
00:13:38,140 --> 00:13:40,640
你让他跟你一起看那些恐怖电视剧
You let him watch those scary shows with you,

421
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:42,740
然后我们大晚上把他一人留在家
and then we leave him home alone at night.

422
00:13:42,740 --> 00:13:44,448
他当然会武装自己了
Of course he's gonna arm himself.

423
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:46,740
你给他讲"50种死法"前他都挺好的
He was fine until you gave him your "50 Ways to Die" speech.

424
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,100
有关"欢迎到来"地毯的说的是什么来着
What was the one about the welcome mat?

425
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,340
那种地毯非常易燃
They are highly flammable.

426
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:50,720
每年有7到10人死于地毯自燃
For seven to ten people a year,

427
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,980
毯子上不如写"欢迎来停尸房"好了
they may as well say, "Welcome to the morgue."

428
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:53,820
好了 别说了
You know what? Drop it.

429
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:54,740
我不想在公共场合吵架
I don't want to fight in public.

430
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:55,820
-太丢人了 -好吧
- It's embarrassing. - Fine.

431
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:57,640
你好吗
Hi, how are you?

432
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:58,600
晚上好 我很好
Good evening. Good.

433
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,900
我的腿麻了
Oh, my leg's asleep!

434
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:01,920
我的腿麻了 好了 谢谢
My leg's asleep! Okay, thank you.

435
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:10,020
先生 如果您的朋友们还不到
Sir, if the rest of your party doesn't arrive soon,

436
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:11,160
恐怕就得把桌子让给别人了
we have to give up your table.

437
00:14:11,380 --> 00:14:11,780
马上就到
Any minute.

438
00:14:12,020 --> 00:14:13,400
再次道歉 爸 我们迟到了
Again, dad, sorry we're late.

439
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:15,620
是啊 米奇尔放了点音乐
Yeah, you know, Mitchell put on some music,

440
00:14:15,620 --> 00:14:17,600
我们边收拾边跳起舞来了
and we were primping and dancing around,

441
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,520
然后可能就忘记了时间
and I guess, well, we just lost track of time.

442
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,800
事实上 爸 真实情况是
Actually, dad, what happened

443
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:23,140
小卡玩了个把戏
was Cam was practicing this trick

444
00:14:23,140 --> 00:14:24,480
假装善解人意 却神不知鬼不觉地
where he pretends to be accommodating

445
00:14:24,480 --> 00:14:25,880
得到了自己想要的结果
and then magically gets his way.

446
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:27,540
他们来了
There they are.

447
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:28,540
我们要离开一下
We need a second.

448
00:14:28,540 --> 00:14:28,940
小卡 别
Oh, Cam, no.

449
00:14:28,940 --> 00:14:30,960
你们要去哪
Where are you guys going?

450
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,040
我不想说话 太生气了
Can't talk. Too mad.

451
00:14:34,292 --> 00:14:35,362
天哪
Oh, God.

452
00:14:38,980 --> 00:14:39,980
爸
Hi, dad.

453
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:40,900
歌洛莉亚在哪里
Where's Gloria?

454
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:42,980
她 看在老天爷的份上
She -- for the love of --

455
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:44,220
你们来了
There you are!

456
00:14:44,220 --> 00:14:47,660
我的天啊 这裙子
Oh, my goodness! That dress!

457
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:49,220
歌洛莉亚 好家伙
Gloria, holy mackerel.

458
00:14:49,640 --> 00:14:50,780
真抱歉 我们迟到了
We're so sorry we're late.

459
00:14:50,860 --> 00:14:52,540
我们不得不把卢克送到你们家
We had to drop Luke off at your place.

460
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:55,460
菲尔想让他自己呆在家 但他害怕
Phil wanted him to stay home alone, but he got scared.

461
00:14:55,880 --> 00:14:57,020
老天 真想赶紧吃点东西
Man, I can't wait to get some food

462
00:14:57,020 --> 00:14:58,340
用食物堵住你的嘴
in my mouth and yours.

463
00:14:58,340 --> 00:14:59,320
可怜的海莉
Poor Haley.

464
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:01,300
她带着那些男孩子要怎么办啊
What is she going to do with all those boys?

465
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,860
*我会陪着他*
*I'll be with him*

466
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:06,180
*我料到你会*
*I know you will*

467
00:15:06,180 --> 00:15:08,800
*搭午夜的火车去往乔治亚*
*On that midnight train to Georgia*

468
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:10,873
*搭午夜去往乔治亚的火车离去*
*Leaving on the midnight train to Georgia*

469
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,520
你知道么
You know what?

470
00:15:14,780 --> 00:15:17,540
我很讨厌你觉得我每次都得偿所愿
I resent the implication that I always get my way.

471
00:15:17,540 --> 00:15:19,570
真的吗 "预留时间"卡片
Really? The "Save the date" cards.

472
00:15:19,580 --> 00:15:20,320
为我们婚礼准备的那个吗
For our wedding?

473
00:15:20,621 --> 00:15:22,020
那还是"我们"的婚礼啊
Oh. So, it is still our wedding.

474
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:23,360
我都不确定我是否被邀请了
I wasn't sure I was even invited

475
00:15:23,371 --> 00:15:25,320
因为尽管你一直问我的意见
because you keep asking for my opinion

476
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,580
最后却总是按自己的意愿去做
and then doing the exact opposite.

477
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:28,320
-那只是特例 -那音乐呢
- That's one thing. - What about the music?

478
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:30,449
我们的爱值得乐队来衬托 而不是DJ
I think our love deserves a band, not a D.J.

479
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:31,080
那桌布呢
The tablecloths.

480
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:32,660
那种料子结实到可以用来做球鞋
They make sneakers out of that fabric.

481
00:15:32,740 --> 00:15:34,800
你什么都不让我选 你想知道为什么吗
You won't let me pick one thing, and you want to know why?

482
00:15:34,860 --> 00:15:36,020
因为我的品味比你好
Because I have better taste than you.

483
00:15:37,038 --> 00:15:38,982
我想说的是因为你是个控制狂
I was gonna say because you're a control freak.

484
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,840
你怎么能认为我品味不好呢
And how can you think that I have bad taste?

485
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:44,000
我们今天选了一模一样的装扮
We chose the exact same outfit.

486
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:44,600
真的吗
Did we?

487
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:46,040
我穿了轻松的懒汉鞋
I wore fun loafers.

488
00:15:46,040 --> 00:15:47,200
你穿了实用的牛津鞋
You wore sensible oxfords.

489
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:48,520
你的领口系的紧
Your collar's buttoned down.

490
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:49,800
我的是时下流行的敞开状
Mine's a more current widespread.

491
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:51,180
我选了一条醒目的方巾
And I chose a bold pocket square

492
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:52,900
去衬托衬衫的条纹
to bring out the stripe in the shirt,

493
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:54,420
所有这些都是你想不到的
all of which you wouldn't have thought of.

494
00:15:54,420 --> 00:15:56,860
原因呢 我刚刚已经说过了
Because, well, I've already said.

495
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:58,880
你不喜欢我的牛津鞋吗
You don't like my oxfords?

496
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,760
对不起 我嘴太毒了
I'm sorry. I'm being harsh.

497
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:03,300
-他们还说得过去 -谢谢
- They're fine. - Thank you.

498
00:16:03,460 --> 00:16:04,640
如果你是个乡村侦探的话
For a small-town detective.

499
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:07,820
好吧 我没忍住 我又毒舌了
Okay, look. I can't help myself. I did it again.

500
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:09,754
我不爱你的鞋
So, I-I don't love them.

501
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,320
但我爱你
But I do love you.

502
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:13,000
我不想让你感觉被冷落
And I don't want you to feel left out.

503
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:16,780
好 那让我在婚礼策划中有话语权
Okay. Then let me have a say in planning our wedding.

504
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:17,960
我们之前说好了的
That's what we agreed to.

505
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:20,600
你会的 你也应该有 对不起
You will, and you should, and I'm sorry.

506
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:22,380
谢谢
Thank you.

507
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:25,220
那你能为我做一件事吗
Can you just do one thing for me?

508
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:25,920
当然
Sure.

509
00:16:26,700 --> 00:16:28,940
实话回答我 然后我就不会再提
Just be honest, and I'll let this go forever.

510
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:31,120
你到底有没有摇那罐汽水
Did you shake that can?

511
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:32,520
没有
No.

512
00:16:34,900 --> 00:16:37,700
我再问一遍
I'm gonna ask you one more time.

513
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,000
看到了吗 菲尔
See, Phil?

514
00:16:39,060 --> 00:16:40,880
他们不让曼尼独自呆在家
They don't let Manny stay home alone.

515
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:41,980
要不然为什么海莉会在那里
Why do you think Haley's there?

516
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:44,040
事实上 我们经常让曼尼自己在家
Actually, we let Manny stay home all the time,

517
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:45,940
有时 他还会做小蛋糕
and sometimes, he makes cupcakes,

518
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:48,160
现在要是能吃上一个就好了
which I could use one right about now --

519
00:16:48,192 --> 00:16:49,473
或者烤土豆也行
or a potato.

520
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,260
海莉是去照顾乔的
Haley's there to take care of Joe.

521
00:16:51,620 --> 00:16:52,300
你们确定么
Are you sure, guys?

522
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,560
因为克莱尔说的所有事都是对的
'cause Claire's always right about everything

523
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:54,660
一直以来 永永远远都是对的
all the time, forever and ever.

524
00:16:56,440 --> 00:16:58,140
谢天谢地 他们来了
Thank god. Here they are.

525
00:16:58,320 --> 00:16:59,420
菲奥纳 我们都到了
Fiona, we're all here.

526
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:00,780
事实上 爸 我们需要点时间
Actually, dad, we could use a moment.

527
00:17:00,958 --> 00:17:02,999
我要吃我的手了
I'm going to eat my hand.

528
00:17:04,327 --> 00:17:05,520
"乔马上坐起来了"
"Jo immediately sat up,

529
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:07,440
"把手插进了口袋 开始吹口哨"
"put her hands in her pockets, and began to whistle.

530
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:09,640
"别这样 乔 太像男孩子了"
"Don't, Jo. It's so boyish."

531
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,620
"我就想这样"
"That's why I do it."

532
00:17:10,620 --> 00:17:13,080
"粗鲁的假小子最讨厌了"
"I detest rude, unladylike girls."

533
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:15,285
"没个性又做作的小孩才讨厌"
"I hate affected, niminy-piminy chits."

534
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:17,360
好吧 烂透了 我放弃
Okay, this stinks. I give up.

535
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:18,800
谢天谢地
Thank god.

536
00:17:19,020 --> 00:17:20,120
想看看自己的头发吗
Want to see your hair?

537
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,800
莉莉 还挺好看的呢
Lily, that's actually good.

538
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:26,540
你真会化妆吗
Can you really do makeup?

539
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:28,380
好生等着
Stay there.

540
00:17:31,280 --> 00:17:34,000
你在做这么大的决定前该跟我商量下
Is it really too much to ask that you consult me

541
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,340
我这个要求真的很过分吗
before you make such a big decision?

542
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:36,680
克莱尔 你决定重返职场时
Claire, when you went back to work,

543
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:37,960
把大权交付给了我
you asked me to take the reins.

544
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,600
那么你现在应当信任我才对
So I think you need to trust me now.

545
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:41,940
你真觉得我会让儿子陷入险境吗
Do you really think I'd put Luke in a dangerous situation?

546
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,660
我最疼他了 这话你就当没听见
He's my favorite, which I did not just say.

547
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:46,040
-如果他出点什么岔子 -不会的
- If anything happens to him... - It won't.

548
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:47,940
你没注意到吗 其实我很擅长处理这些
If you haven't noticed, I'm pretty good at this,

549
00:17:47,940 --> 00:17:49,640
就跟你吝于夸赞我一样
as hard as it is for you to pay me a compliment.

550
00:17:49,928 --> 00:17:51,416
你这话什么意思
Where is that coming from?

551
00:17:52,040 --> 00:17:53,380
那你喜欢这套西服吗
Well, do you like this suit?

552
00:17:54,220 --> 00:17:54,940
我无从知道
I wouldn't know

553
00:17:54,960 --> 00:17:56,320
因为你只说它"有点儿紧"
because all you said was, "It's tight,"

554
00:17:56,330 --> 00:17:57,939
而且还不是开玩笑说的
and not in a cool black way.

555
00:17:58,111 --> 00:17:59,740
等等 你是想说你把自己
Wait, a-are you trying to say

556
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:01,760
塞进这身西装是为了取悦我吗
that you squeezed yourself in that for me?

557
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:02,620
是的
Yes.

558
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:04,820
你最近被工作弄得有些心烦
You've been a little distracted at work,

559
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:06,180
所以我想为你打扮一下
so I wanted to look nice for you.

560
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:08,520
亲爱的
Oh, honey.

561
00:18:09,720 --> 00:18:11,920
我不好 是我不好
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

562
00:18:12,520 --> 00:18:13,240
你是对的
You're right.

563
00:18:13,860 --> 00:18:15,400
卢克可能本来好好的
Luke probably would have been fine,

564
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,520
是我自己放不下
and I am having a hard time letting go.

565
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:20,280
如果这世上我只信任一个人 那就是你
And if there's one person in the world I trust, it is you.

566
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:21,260
还有呢
And?

567
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:27,120
还有 你穿这套西装真性感
And...you look hot in that suit.

568
00:18:28,260 --> 00:18:29,260
一会儿我们回家...
When we get home later...

569
00:18:29,340 --> 00:18:31,080
行了 千万别往下说了
Okay, you're actually gonna need to stop.

570
00:18:31,090 --> 00:18:32,853
这西服已经紧得不能再紧了
This suit can't get any tighter.

571
00:18:33,620 --> 00:18:34,640
我们回来啦
Hey, we're back.

572
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:35,740
谁都不许再离开了
Nobody goes anywhere.

573
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:38,580
大家手拉手 我们赶紧去坐下
Everybody hold hands, and we go right to the table.

574
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:39,340
菲奥纳
Fiona?

575
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:42,200
实际上 我们把你们的桌子给别人了
Actually, we just gave away your table.

576
00:18:42,620 --> 00:18:44,720
实在抱歉 但我提醒过你的
I'm sorry, but I did warn you about this.

577
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:45,960
你给我听着 菲奥莉娜
Listen to me, Fiorina.

578
00:18:46,380 --> 00:18:47,980
这男人为了在你家馆子吃饭
This man has been waiting

579
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:50,040
已经等了好几个月了
to eat in this restaurant for months!

580
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:52,640
我们都很自私 害他迟到
We were all selfish, and we made him late.

581
00:18:52,740 --> 00:18:54,040
也许我是有点过分
And maybe I got a little crazy,

582
00:18:54,060 --> 00:18:55,500
但这个等下再考虑
but I'm gonna think about that later.

583
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,400
但他没做错什么
But he has done nothing wrong!

584
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:59,040
所以在他吃到他天天念叨的
So we're not gonna leave this place

585
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:01,039
醉牛之前 我们是绝对不会
until he eats that drunk cow

586
00:19:01,039 --> 00:19:03,306
离开这个地方的
that he can't shut up his mouth about!

587
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:06,080
怎么还傻愣在那
Why you haven't moved?

588
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:09,640
昨晚我吃到了人生中最美味的一餐
Last night, I had the greatest meal I've ever had,

589
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,440
要不是因为歌洛莉亚让我们
and it never would have happened

590
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:13,400
被那店大欺客的餐厅赶了出来
if Gloria hadn't got us kicked out

591
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,560
我是没办法享受到的
of that snooty restaurant.

592
00:19:17,740 --> 00:19:18,380
玉米饼
Tacos.

593
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:21,220
-玉米饼 -我得吃一个
- Tacos. - I need a taco.

594
00:19:21,230 --> 00:19:23,248
-太好了 -玉米饼贩卖车
- Yes. - Taco truck!

595
00:19:28,297 --> 00:19:29,701
太好吃了
That is delicious.

596
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:31,660
说真的 谁穿得更好看
No, but seriously, who looks better?

597
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:35,400
也不知道是因为等他们时喝掉的
I don't know if it was the six scotches I drank

598
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:36,300
六杯苏格兰威士忌作祟
waiting for everybody,

599
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:39,000
还是因为我早饭之后就没吃过东西
or the fact that I hadn't eaten anything since breakfast...

600
00:19:39,200 --> 00:19:42,720
或是因为菲尔的西服终于撑不住了
or the moment Phil's suit finally gave up.

601
00:19:44,760 --> 00:19:47,080
他们甚至放了我最爱的音乐
They even played my favorite song.

602
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,853
*他正离去*
*He's leaving*

603
00:19:49,039 --> 00:19:49,832
*离去*
*Leaving*

604
00:19:50,909 --> 00:19:53,612
*搭午夜的火车去往乔治亚*
*On that midnight train to Georgia*

605
00:19:53,612 --> 00:19:55,581
*搭午夜的火车离去*
*Leaving on the midnight train*

606
00:19:56,726 --> 00:19:58,969
*说要回去找寻*
*Said he's going back to find*

607
00:19:59,508 --> 00:20:00,937
*回去找寻*
*Going back to find*

608
00:20:00,947 --> 00:20:04,003
*那更单纯的地方和时光*
*the simpler place and time*

609
00:20:04,238 --> 00:20:05,785
*是的 他正离去*
*Oh, yes, he is*

610
00:20:06,529 --> 00:20:08,919
*我会陪着他*
*And I'll be with him*

611
00:20:08,919 --> 00:20:10,241
*是的 他要离去*
*Yes, he will*

612
00:20:10,437 --> 00:20:13,316
*搭午夜的火车去往乔治亚*
*On that midnight train to Georgia*

613
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:15,580
我永远赶不上午夜列车
A train I'd never make

614
00:20:16,004 --> 00:20:18,501
除非我告诉歌洛莉亚火车11点开
unless I told Gloria it left at 11:00.

615
00:20:18,596 --> 00:20:20,905
*我宁愿活在他的世界里*
*I'd rather live in his world*

616
00:20:21,725 --> 00:20:24,439
*也不愿独自过活*
*than live without him in mine*

617
00:20:28,180 --> 00:20:29,320
给你
Here you go.

618
00:20:29,980 --> 00:20:31,000
不知道你要喝什么
I didn't know what you wanted to drink,

619
00:20:31,020 --> 00:20:32,160
所以就买了汽水
so I just got you this soda.

620
00:20:32,340 --> 00:20:33,780
可以的 谢谢
That's fine. Thank you.

621
00:20:36,180 --> 00:20:37,180
小卡 你动了什么手脚
Cam, what did you do?

622
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:38,920
动了跟你一样的手脚
I did exactly what you did

623
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,360
因为我太了解你了
because I know you so well.

624
00:20:40,820 --> 00:20:42,400
我没摇那罐汽水
I didn't shake the soda.

625
00:20:42,620 --> 00:20:44,180
那就没什么可担心的了
Then you have nothing to worry about,

626
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,420
直接打开吧
so go ahead and open it.

627
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,360
我摇了 好吧
I shook it, okay?

628
00:20:50,360 --> 00:20:51,820
我的确摇了 是我摇的
I shook the soda. I shook it up!

629
00:20:51,940 --> 00:20:52,820
满意了吗
Are you happy?

630
00:20:53,300 --> 00:20:54,700
我的行为小心眼 愚蠢还很恶毒
It was petty and stupid and awful.

631
00:20:54,740 --> 00:20:55,380
对不起
I'm sorry.

632
00:20:56,580 --> 00:20:57,260
该死
Damn it.
